      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Bites. Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (2d4) Piercing damage, or 2 (1d4) Piercing damage if the swarm is Bloodied.",
      "sourceLocator": {
